{"day":16,"title_ko":"안경 어디 갔지?","title_en":"Where are my glasses?","setting_ko":"마이크의 새 사무실에 들렀는데, 마이크가 안경을 찾아요","grammar":"perfect_vs_past","cast":[{"name":"Jiwoo","me":true},{"name":"Mike","me":false}],"lines":[{"n":1,"who":"Jiwoo","me":true,"en":"Hi, Mike. When did you start your new job?","sp":"Hi, Mike. When'dja start yer new job?","hk":"하이, 마익. 웬쥬 스타트 여 뉴 잡?","ko":"마이크, 새 일은 언제 시작했어요?","red":[{"w":"When did you","h":"When'dja","k":"웬쥬","r":"when_did_you"},{"w":"your","h":"yer","k":"여","r":"your_yer"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d016/l01_","gap":600},{"n":2,"who":"Mike","me":false,"en":"Last Monday. Oh no. I've lost my glasses. I had them this morning.","sp":"Las' Monday. Oh no. I've los' my glasses. I had 'em this mornin'.","hk":"래스 먼데이. 오 노. 아이브 로스 마이 글래시즈. 아이 해럼 디스 모닌.","ko":"지난 월요일이요. 아이고, 안경을 잃어버렸어요. 아침에는 있었는데.","red":[{"w":"lost my","h":"los' my","k":"로스 마이","r":"t_drop"},{"w":"had them","h":"had 'em","k":"해럼","r":"them_em"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d016/l02_","gap":600},{"n":3,"who":"Jiwoo","me":true,"en":"When did you last see them?","sp":"When'dja las' see 'em?","hk":"웬쥬 래스 씨엄?","ko":"마지막으로 본 게 언제예요?","red":[{"w":"When did you","h":"When'dja","k":"웬쥬","r":"when_did_you"},{"w":"them","h":"'em","k":"엄","r":"them_em"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d016/l03_","gap":600},{"n":4,"who":"Mike","me":false,"en":"At the café. I read the menu with them.","sp":"At the café. I read the menu with 'em.","hk":"앳 더 캐페이. 아이 레드 더 메뉴 위덤.","ko":"카페에서요. 그걸로 메뉴를 읽었어요.","red":[{"w":"with them","h":"with 'em","k":"위덤","r":"them_em"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d016/l04_","gap":600},{"n":5,"who":"Jiwoo","me":true,"en":"Have you called the café?","sp":"Havya called the café?","hk":"해뷰 콜드 더 캐페이?","ko":"카페에 전화해 봤어요?","red":[{"w":"Have you","h":"Havya","k":"해뷰","r":"have_you"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d016/l05_","gap":600},{"n":6,"who":"Mike","me":false,"en":"Yes, I called them ten minutes ago. They haven't found them.","sp":"Yeah, I called 'em ten minutes-ago. They haven' found 'em.","hk":"예, 아이 콜덤 텐 미닛처고. 데이 해븐 파운덤.","ko":"네, 10분 전에 전화했어요. 못 찾았대요.","red":[{"w":"called them","h":"called 'em","k":"콜덤","r":"them_em"},{"w":"haven't","h":"haven'","k":"해븐","r":"t_drop"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d016/l06_","gap":600},{"n":7,"who":"Jiwoo","me":true,"en":"Hmm. Did you look in your bag?","sp":"Hmm. Didja look-in yer bag?","hk":"흠. 디쥬 루낀 여 백?","ko":"음. 가방은 봤어요?","red":[{"w":"Did you","h":"Didja","k":"디쥬","r":"did_you"},{"w":"your","h":"yer","k":"여","r":"your_yer"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d016/l07_","gap":600},{"n":8,"who":"Mike","me":false,"en":"I didn't. Wait… Here they are! I've found them!","sp":"I didn'. Wait… Here they are! I've found 'em!","hk":"아이 디든. 웨잇… 히어 데이 아! 아이브 파운덤!","ko":"안 봤어요. 잠깐만… 여기 있네! 찾았어요!","red":[{"w":"didn't","h":"didn'","k":"디든","r":"t_drop"},{"w":"found them","h":"found 'em","k":"파운덤","r":"them_em"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d016/l08_","gap":600},{"n":9,"who":"Jiwoo","me":true,"en":"Ha! When did you put them there?","sp":"Ha! When'dja pud 'em there?","hk":"하! 웬쥬 푸럼 데어?","ko":"하하! 언제 거기 넣었어요?","red":[{"w":"When did you","h":"When'dja","k":"웬쥬","r":"when_did_you"},{"w":"put them","h":"pud 'em","k":"푸럼","r":"flap_t"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d016/l09_","gap":600},{"n":10,"who":"Mike","me":false,"en":"I don't remember!","sp":"I don' remember!","hk":"아이 돈 리멤버!","ko":"기억이 안 나요!","red":[{"w":"don't","h":"don'","k":"돈","r":"t_drop"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d016/l10_","gap":600}],"drill":[{"id":"d016_q1","line":5,"prompt":"____ called the café?","ans":"Have you","ch":["Have you","Did you","Do you"],"heard":"Havya","k":"해뷰","rule":"have_you"},{"id":"d016_q2","line":1,"prompt":"Hi, Mike. ____ start your new job?","ans":"When did you","ch":["When did you","When were you","When are you"],"heard":"When'dja","k":"웬쥬","rule":"when_did_you"},{"id":"d016_q3","line":3,"prompt":"When did you last see ____?","ans":"them","ch":["them","then","thumb"],"heard":"'em","k":"엄","rule":"them_em"},{"id":"d016_q4","line":7,"prompt":"Hmm. Did you look in ____ bag?","ans":"your","ch":["your","you","year"],"